<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina maintains crop estimates steady.</title>
<headline>Argentina maintains crop estimates steady.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Argentine government's Agricultural Secretariat maintained its previous estimates for 1996/97 maize, soybean, sunflower and wheat production steady in a document released Monday.</p>
<p>The Secretariat forecast output of 15.2 million tonnes of wheat, 14.6 million tonnes of maize, 13.7 million tonnes of soybeans and 5.6 million tonnes of sunflower seed.</p>
<p>The estimates were contained in the Secretariat's weekly crop report, dated January 31.</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
